<div data-ob-island="about"><div class="min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground"><main><section class="relative flex h-130 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden md:h-150"><img alt="Warm natural sunlight filtering through premium custom sheer roller blinds in a modern living room" class="object-cover" sizes="100vw" src="{{ 'ob-86a62b2a81-hero-bg.webp' | asset_url }}" loading="eager" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[rgba(31,41,51,0.58)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex max-w-245 flex-col items-center gap-4 px-6 text-center md:px-8"><h1 class="font-display text-[38px] leading-[1.08] text-white sm:text-[48px] md:text-[60px]">Designed for Light. <span class="italic">Built for Life.</span></h1><p class="max-w-190 text-[16px] leading-7 text-white/78 md:text-[18px]">Light changes how a space feels. It sets the mood of a room, defines comfort, and shapes how we experience our homes every day.</p></div></section><section class="px-6 py-20 md:px-10 lg:px-14"><div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-308 grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:gap-20"><div><h2 class="font-display text-[32px] leading-10 text-foreground md:text-[36px]">Our Story</h2><div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-[16px] leading-6.5 text-muted"><p>At Online Blinds, we&#x27;ve spent over 15 years understanding the relationship between light and living - how to filter light softly, how to block it completely, and how to give homeowners full control over it.</p><p>Our journey began in 2008, working hands-on with window coverings across multiple markets and countries. Over time, we mastered the materials, the mechanics, and the craftsmanship behind high-quality blinds and shades.</p><p>We created Online Blinds to make premium, custom window coverings simple, accessible, and reliable - without showroom pressure, inflated prices, or guesswork.</p></div></div><div class="relative h-75 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl sm:h-85 lg:h-82.25">